BARANGAY CLEARANCE

REQUIREMENTS:

    A. Old residents: Valid ID and current Community Tax Certification(CTC)
    B. New residents: Registered on the Barangay Census, Valid ID, current CTC and endorsement from the house owner for boarders/transients.

STEPS ON HOW TO GET BARANGAY CLEARANCE: 

    1. Go to Barangay Hall with the Barangay clearance requirements and log in on the record book with the purpose to 
       the Officer of the Day.
    
    2. OIC/Secretary prepares the Barangay Cleareance for the particular purpose with the current CTC and signed by the applicant. 
    
    3. Punong Barangay will sign the prepared Barangay Clearance and pay the barangay clearance fee of ₱100.00 to the Barangay 
       Treasurer and receive the Official Receipt before claiming the clearance.
